AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002232> "x 'has end location' y if and only if there exists some process z such that x 'ends with' z and z 'occurs in' y")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002232> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/subsets#ro-eco>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002232> "has end location"@en)
