# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002234> (has output)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002234> "p has output c iff c is a participant in p, c is present at the end of p, and c is not present in the same state at the beginning of p.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002234> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/valid_for_go_annotation_extension>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002234> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/valid_for_go_ontology>)
