AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002353> "inverse of has output")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002353> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002259>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002353> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/subsets#ro-eco>)
