# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00002872> (bagasse)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bagasse") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00002872> "The biomass remaining after sugarcane stalks are crushed to extract their juice.")
