# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00003031> (animal manure)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00003031> "Manure which is derived from the waste products of animals."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00003031> "This is interesting in that the \"role\" aspect of \"waste\" is (or can be) replaced by another role \"fertilizer\". Thus, the positioning of \"manure\" under waste may not be totally correct.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00003031> "animal manure")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00003031> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03501300>)

