EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000219> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000446> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002354> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000952>)))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000219> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000446>)
