AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000408> "A site which has its extent determined by the presence or influence of one or more components of an environmental system or the processes occurring therein.")
