AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000451> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/envo#envoPolar>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000451> "This could also be considered a part of an environmental material like air.")
