AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000638> "crust")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000638> "This class is meant to be applicable accross planets. Earth's crust would be an instance.")
