AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000658> "See also: http://www.ecotope.org/anthromes/v1/guide/urban/12_dense_settlements/default.aspx")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000658> "The thresholds for what makes a settlment \"dense\" can be determined as needed. If there is a specific threshold that should be added to ENVO, please make a new class request.")
