# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000793> (atmospheric wind)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000793> "wind")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wind") <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000793> "A mass gaseous flow which occurrs in a planet's atmosphere due to internal pressure disequilibria.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000793> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/envo#envoAtmo>)
