# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001245> (woodland ecosystem)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodland") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001245> "An ecosystem which is determined by communities of plants with a tree growth form and in which members of those communities are spaced sufficiently far apart to allow sunlight to illuminate the understory.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001245> "The correct usage of FLOPO terms in the axiomatisation needs to be confirmed.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001245> "Woodland understories are often populated with communities of shrubs and herbaceous plants including grasses. There are varying distinctions between woodland and forest, with a large degree of ambiguity.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001245> "woodland ecosystem"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001245> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001790>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001245> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000335>))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001245> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001240>))

