AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001431> "There are multiple systems of land use classification. This hierarchy aims to be generally applicable, but national systems can be added on request.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001431> "land use process"@en)
