AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001966> "The limits of what qualifies as \"adjacent to\" vary greatly. This should be defined on a data level and is left intentionally fuzzy here. The label is \"coastal sea water\" rather than \"coastal water\" as some large lakes are often said to have coasts.")
