AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manure>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03501300> "An environmental material consisting of organic matter from plants and/or animals that is used in agriculture as fertilizer."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03501300> "animal manure"@en)
