AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105203> "While called \"depth\", this is not the depth of the water table but rather how far it is below a reference plane, usually the soil surface. Thus, this is placed under PATO:elevation which allows for distance above and below a reference point."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105203> "water table depth"@en)
