AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Photosynthetically_active_radiation>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://www.waveformlighting.com/horticulture/what-is-the-difference-between-ppfd-and-ppf>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105213> "A flux which inheres in photosynthetically active radiation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105213> "PPF"@en)
