# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105271> (soil texture)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105271> "Texture which inheres in soil."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105271> "soil texture"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_06105271> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000150> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00001998>)))
